            <div xml:id="d344">

                <pb facs="0573" n="471" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg471"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.S1/569: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Atherton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-03-17T11:00:00-05:00">March 17, 1933—11
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>53. Have you any information as to the significance of the conference between
                    Bonnet, the French Finance Minister, and the British Cabinet?</p>
                <p>Please report any immediate developments of significance by wire and further by
                    mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cordell Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
